class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Starter\" title=\"Starter\">Starter</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Starter\" title=\"Starter\">Starter</a>:</b> Starter equipment cannot be traded, sold or crafted.<br /><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Battleworn_Breastplate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Battleworn_Breastplate.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This breastplate appears to be of exceptional quality despite years of use.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>All new non-<a href=\"/page/Veteran_Status\" title=\"Veteran Status\">Veteran</a>, non-<a href=\"/page/Warforged\" title=\"Warforged\">Warforged</a> <a href=\"/page/Artificer\" title=\"Artificer\">Artificers</a>, <a href=\"/page/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Clerics